This product is derived from leads-crm-app-demo
(https://github.com/alphinside/leads-crm-app-demo),
the sample app for the Google codelab on AI code review
with the Antigravity CLI and SDK, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications: the UI was rebuilt with the Qorelly V2
design, the AI Studio and Gemini features were removed,
and the seed data was replaced with a Nigerian SME
context. The API routes and database schema are kept.

Icons: Solar by 480 Design
(https://www.figma.com/community/file/1166831539721848736),
licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
A subset is bundled in src/lib/solar-icons.json.
